SCC PORTABLE KERNEL
===================

The ports are conformance experiments, not historical claims. Python remains the
reference implementation. BASIC and Forth intentionally expose the minimum
semantic kernel needed to derive a warrant without importing Python object
semantics.

Profiles:
  SCC-BASIC-16       constrained BASIC; external cryptographic verifier allowed
  SCC-BASIC-32       fuller FreeBASIC-class implementation
  SCC-FORTH-ANS      portable stack-machine authorization kernel
  SCC-FORTH-GFORTH   host adapters for files/processes/crypto

All profiles obey the Anti-Assertion Mandate: unavailable evidence is not TRUE.
See docs/porting-guide.md and ports/vectors/.
